## Rule: CAR shell vs GB-type passing game (reusable)
- **Single-high (MOFC) + man:** take deep outside shots with explosive WRs against the CB in man. Tonight: Golden 24 TD, plus several deep incompletions. High variance; lean to WR long-catch/yardage overs only with a CB2/CB3 in coverage.
- **Two-high (MOFO) + zone:** the TE and crossers win underneath (Kraft outs/flats, Golden shallow crossers). The deep middle gets beaten when the safeties split (Watson 53 on W. Lee, Sturdivant post).
- Use the pregame shell rate (Sharp single-high 56.8%) to weight the two.
